00:19:15.920 --> 00:19:16.400
But

00:19:16.519 --> 00:19:17.480
I have to say,

00:19:17.480 --> 00:19:19.000
when she stood up to Ma Na in public,

00:19:19.880 --> 00:19:21.039
that took real guts.

00:19:23.039 --> 00:19:24.200
Then she disappeared.

00:19:25.240 --> 00:19:26.680
